IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgta-nouns`

-- INSTRUMENT: Telecommunications (Exemption of Resellers of Local Calls Operating Coinafons or Payphones) Notification 2007 (S 77/2007), made by
-- the Minister under section 73 of the Act (section 96 in the 2020 Revised Edition), in operation 1 March 2007.  Text: TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007 under
-- subjects/sg/telecommunications-resellers-coinafons-notification-2007/registers/source-bundle/.  A date before 1 March 2007 answers NOTHING.

§ `Resellers of local calls operating coinafons or payphones: exemption`

-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:22 | 1. This Notification may be cited as the Telecommunications (Exemption of Resellers of
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:23 | Local Calls Operating Coinafons or Payphones) Notification 2007 and shall come into
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:24 | operation on 1st March 2007.
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:26 | Exemption
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:27 | 2. —(1) Subject to sub-paragraph (2), any person who operates coinafons or coin-
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:28 | operated or card-operated customer premises payphones in one or more premises for the
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:29 | purpose of providing local call services by way of resale shall be exempted from
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:30 | licensing under section 5 of the Act in respect of those services if, and only if —
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:31 | (a) he provides access to public emergency call services free-of-charge;
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:32 | (b) he provides local calls at a rate of 10 cents per 2 minutes or longer; and
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:33 | (c) where he provides local calls at any rate other than 10 cents per 3 minutes, he
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:34 | notifies his customers in advance of the rate for his services —
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:35 | (i) by publication on or adjacent to, or by announcement through, each
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:36 | coinafon or payphone; or
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:37 | (ii) in such other similar manner as the Authority may approve.
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:38 | (2) The exemption in sub-paragraph (1) shall not apply or shall cease to apply, as the
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:39 | case may be, in respect of a person who is granted a licence to provide facilities-based
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:40 | operations under section 5 of the Act.
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:41 | Revocation
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:42 | 3. The Telecommunication Authority of Singapore (Exemption of Resellers of Local
-- src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:43 | Calls Operating Coinafons and Payphones) Order (O 2) is revoked.
@ref Resellers Notification 2007 (src:TA1999-RESELL-S77-2007:22-43)
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Resellers Notification reg 1: the Notification is in operation on the date (from 1 March 2007)` MEANS
    d AT LEAST (Date 1 3 2007)

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the person operates coinafons or coin-operated or card-operated customer premises payphones in one or more premises to provide local call services by way of resale` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person provides access to public emergency call services free-of-charge` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person provides local calls at a rate of 10 cents per 2 minutes or longer` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person provides local calls at a rate other than 10 cents per 3 minutes` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person notifies customers in advance of the rate by publication on or adjacent to, or announcement through, each coinafon or payphone, or in another similar manner the Authority approves` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is granted a licence to provide facilities-based operations under section 5 of the Act` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Resellers Notification reg 2: the person is exempted from licensing under section 5 of the Act in respect of those services` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 1 3 2007) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST (    `the person operates coinafons or coin-operated or card-operated customer premises payphones in one or more premises to provide local call services by way of resale`
                           AND `the person provides access to public emergency call services free-of-charge`
                           AND `the person provides local calls at a rate of 10 cents per 2 minutes or longer`
                           AND ((NOT `the person provides local calls at a rate other than 10 cents per 3 minutes`) OR `the person notifies customers in advance of the rate by publication on or adjacent to, or announcement through, each coinafon or payphone, or in another similar manner the Authority approves`)
                           AND (NOT `the person is granted a licence to provide facilities-based operations under section 5 of the Act`))

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Resellers Notification reg 3: the earlier Order (O 2) is revoked on the date` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 1 3 2007) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST TRUE
